# The homelab worker node's host collector configuration (plan
# homelab-k8s-worker-nodes, DoD assertion 18): the otel-collector
# repository's homelab-worker shape at a pinned commit, and the sha256 the
# start task verifies the delivered copy against in the worker VM. Bump all
# three together when the shape changes (thewoolleyman/otel-collector#21).
#
# pod_file / pod_sha256: the separate keyless pod-span configuration, run as
# otel-collector-pods.service so a cni0 bind failure on a pod-less node cannot
# stop hostmetrics (livespec-dev-tooling-rz23sl, thewoolleyman/otel-collector#23).
# Declare both or neither; bump them with the three above.
